        <p>宏观上 · 是绝对的宿命</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="195" width="370" height="180">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(195, 190, 180, 0.92)" lineSpacing="multiple:2.0">
        <p>只要认知论本体存在，就必然要扩张；</p>
        <p>只要扩张，就必然走向热寂；</p>
        <p>只要热寂，就必然压缩成奇点；</p>
        <p>只要奇点存在，就必然再次大爆炸。</p>
        <p> </p>
        <p>这是物理定律与认知逻辑的<span color="rgba(200, 160, 100, 1)" bold="true">绝对宿命</span>。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="480" startY="155" endX="480" endY="390">
